## Check the implementation

Check keyboard activation, repeated clicks, delayed results, failure and wrapping at narrow widths. Do not mix compact and standard heights in one action group. Use the [Civica accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html), then compare light and dark modes, at least two theme colours, and 320 CSS pixels.

For the label wording, see [Write clear titles](../content/writing-guidelines/clear-titles.html).
